  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Finely chop brown onion.\n• Cut zucchini into half-moons. Trim beans and cut in half. Finely chop or crush garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66186fc5300be64307bdf799-4b00766b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water and add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Cook risoni in boiling water over high heat until 'al dente', 7-8 mins.\n• Drain risoni.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66186fc5300be64307bdf799-a5adf0e1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook onion, zucchini and beans until softened, 4-6 mins.\n• Add garlic, garlic seasoning and vegetable stock and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Remove from heat and add risoni to pan. Add baby spinach, stirring, until combined and wilted, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66186fc5300be64307bdf799-6caddd35.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir through a splash of water to loosen if needed.\n• Stir in Parmesan cheese and red pesto. Season to taste.\n• Divide between bowls. Enjoy.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66186fc5300be64307bdf799-c45279a9.jpeg"
    }
  ]
